or each target typeAdded a Mastery column on the right edge of the HUD showing kills needed for the next rankAdded rank-up toasts, target bursts, and a Mastery tip card, with a setting to turn the toasts offAdded M","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T12:57:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690078","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3175550-1845383656396317","game_id":"steam-3175550","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.20","summary":"v0.20.0This update adds a demo completion screen, refreshed target art with a new damage shatter, and several visual fixes. Added Added a demo completion screen with your play time, targets destroyed, and a Steam wishlist linkAdded a demo completion flow that guides you to finish your training in the talent screenAdded three moss variations for Mossy TargetsAdded an animated fog aura for the Silver Lining talent FixedStreak now has a 30-second cooldown, as described in its updated talent descrip","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T12:52:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656396317","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3175550-1842212951313827","game_id":"steam-3175550","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.19","summary":"v0.19.0Idle Archery now supports six new languages, alongside clearer visuals and improved translated text throughout the game. AddedAdded German, Spanish, French, Japanese, Russian, and Simplified Chinese localizationAdded six new languages to the Language setting FixedTalent nodes now display their intended iconsLong translated labels and buttons now wrap instead of being clipped ChangedReduced scanline and chromatic aberration effects for a clearer displayCompact numbers now use language-appr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-01T15:37:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951313827","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3175550-1842212951309431","game_id":"steam-3175550","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.18","summary":"v0.18.0This version introduces Prestige Strain, refreshed visuals, smoother progression, and several gameplay fixes. This update also improves target reliability, HUD clarity, save performance, and target balance across the range. HighlightsAdded Prestige Strain, making each Prestige Point earned during a run multiply the next Gold goal by 4Refreshed the CRT display effect and corrected cursor alignment on the curved display Added Added animated Prestige Strain indicators and hover details to th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T08:04:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951309431","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3175550-1840944183785974","game_id":"steam-3175550","kind":"announcement","title":"Welcome!","summary":"Hello, archers! At its heart, Idle Archery is about taking one simple shot and turning it into an entire money making range. Destroy targets, hire archers, unlock tougher and more valuable targets, stack upgrades, tune your priorities, and prestige for permanent talents that make every new run snowball faster. The demo is ready to play. The full game is still in development and I need your help to make it better. After playing, I would especially love to hear: Where progression feels too slow or","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T1